==Battleground==
*1 [[Professor A.]] spawns after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Gobble]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Camelle]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*2 [[Gobble]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You can use somewhat a recently unlocked [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]], [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Newtone]] on this stage. Outranging every enemy here and being able to control the [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] and [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies, it doesn't take much effort to win. Keep in mind that Haniwanwan's [[Mini-Wave]]s can reach and possibly Curse him.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Riceball Cat]]: Being immune to both Toxic and Slow, Riceball is the ideal meatshield choice for this stage.
*[[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Carpenter Cat]]: Resists Prof. A and Gobble, with enough bulk to survive a hit from Camelle as well. Especially effective with Research [[Cat Combo|Combos]].

